@title Crane in 3D: the lamps on the control box follow a closed-loop winch of Drive run
@area Simulate
@sizes 1920x1080
# Simulate > Drive run starts the winch of the closed-loop fixture and Hoist in 3D follows it; while the
# hook rises the brake lamp is green and the drive lamp is green, and the line under the controls says rising.
open qa/fixtures/closed-winch.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate drive run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
click_text "Switch on Live"
wait 20
click_text "Start"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Hoist in 3D
wait 4
key Enter
wait 40
key Home
wait 30
shot lamps-before-lifting
mouse_down 371 370
wait 3000
expect "rising"
shot lamps-while-rising
mouse_up 371 370
wait 800
expect "Picture, not measurement"
check_layout
shot lamps-stopped
